SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia\, Nimos islet
LOCATION:Nimos islet\, Symi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 23-24 August the caiques go north from Gialos to the uninhabited islet of Nimos for the feast of the Panagia (Ypakoi/Alithini chapels) with fish\, wine and music on the shore. Boats are the only way\; ask at the Gialos harbour on the 23rd.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nimos-islet-panigiri-of-panagia-nimos-islet
